Leopard Attack in North Kashmir Kills Seven Sheep - Kashmir Life,2025-12-18,Jammu & Kashmir,,Leopard,Livestock Attack,7.0,0.0,0.0,Leopard killed seven sheep in North Kashmir.,0.98,single_incident,,Kashmir Life,https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPdFJVc3d2M0ctY0ZYbHhoWGxzMUI0VDlXXzNkUjdzcjNRNHFJbVJ3VFdRRDhmZ3BIM1NVSGtnSDNscWVaWXc3V29aZHNuTjVzYXBfMWtVSUFlYVJxcXRwV194dHc1cEotWFhNZzZLLXBFNkdTTTI3bEJuUEJKOUM4VnVFb3N0V2Za?oc=5,,,"SRINAGAR: Panic gripped Shiva village on the outskirts of Sopore in north Kashmir’s Baramulla district after a leopard attacked a flock of sheep, killing at least seven and injuring many others.

