Bear Attack Injures Man in North Kashmir - Kashmir Observer,2026-07-27,Jammu & Kashmir,,Asiatic Black Bear,Human Injury,0.0,1.0,0.0,A man was injured in a bear attack.,0.95,single_incident,,Kashmir Observer,https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxPcFNwUTNiQ0pJcTh3TzJjUUtRLUhUSVlFdGtHSGFQN19Xa1NJX2FxOUZoMHFqY2tyanFIbHdfNmR2RXlMUmYzQktyMlRNX3VZaXB4SXI4ZC1xaVdIeE4tNkp2NGo5M3lTaENYWjJTOFlyRnY1dldjUnF5dTBYbUxnS0ZaZjBzRkE?oc=5,,,"File Photo

