“All of them are out of danger and responding well to the treatment,” news agency the official added.","success(newspaper3k, resolved_via_decode, 697 chars)"
Jackal Attack Injures Five In Kashmir - Kashmir Life,2023-05-11,Jammu Kashmir,,Jackal,Human Injury,0.0,5.0,0.0,Five people injured in jackal attack.,0.98,single_incident,,Kashmir Life,https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTFAtSHRjdDlvbXFRdHFIWE5tOVZ2Uk5Xd0tyQWwwOG0zME1GWnNyMkdVdmNDX1VvWi1xVjg5LUo2bkpmMzRqWnpPZlJVNTB5NzhvLUtvaWR5V3ZESXVaaHNLTHAxOG1tUEZSU1h0SVNmRDFKWUJnRWRDZA?oc=5,,,"SRINAGAR: At least 5 persons were injured after being bitten by a jackal in Tarzoo area of Sopore in north Kashmir’s Baramulla district on Thursday.

