Eight goats found dead near Tiruvallur; villagers suspect leopard attack - The Times of India,2023-09-06,,,Goat,Livestock Attack,8.0,0.0,0.0,"Eight goats found dead, suspected to be a leopard attack.",0.5,single_incident,,The Times of India,https://news.google.?oc=5,,,"CHENNAI: Eight goats were found dead with injuries on their neck in a village in Tiruvallur district of Tamil Nadu on Wednesday morning. Though villagers suspect it to be a leopard attack, forest officials said it was too early to jump into conclusions.
According to village assistant V Dhanalakshmi, the goats belonged to Rajini of Movoor near Poondi.
