"16 Sheep Killed, 17 Injured in Suspected Leopard Attack in Chadoora - Brighter Kashmir",2026-09-10,Jammu and Kashmir,Chadoora,Leopard,Livestock Attack,16.0,17.0,0.0,Suspected leopard attack resulted in the death of 16 sheep and injuries to 17 individuals.,0.95,single_incident,,Brighter Kashmir,https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPMHJ2NVcxaGk1bUotOVVUVDQtN3N3TFk4TmJMTzdOY0h2andKdHFULTdyWE5IVm81dVlXY2x4MU9OWGtxb1FqWUJTdkVINHliX2JxRjZYdGh2eXIxRDJzLWgwNzc3dXpGVWVCX0ZFZlV6TE5kZFRQYlhoSG55R09FcXJORmxpSGZVaGVxcUhxcDR5U0FmRmpaUjVudXlObWZHRjlHdGgyOV9mdjFza1E?oc=5,,,"Budgam, September 10: Sixteen sheep were reportedly killed and 17 others injured after a wild animal attacked a flock at Badipora village in the Chadoora area of Budgam district during the intervening night of Wednesday and Thursday.
