In the video, tourists can be seen enjoying the safari, capturing pictures and admiring the park’s scenic beauty from their safari jeep. Suddenly, when the cow was trying to cross the path, a tiger emerged from the bushes and jumped on the cow, leaving tourists shocked. Fortunately, the cow managed to escape before the tiger could harm it further.","success(trafilatura, resolved_via_decode, 2364 chars)"
