Body of Missing Child Found After Leopard Attack in Kulgam - Asian Mail,2024-10-23,Jammu & Kashmir,,Leopard,Human Death,0.0,0.0,1.0,Body of missing child found after leopard attack.,0.98,single_incident,,Asian Mail,https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPMk0yM0FaSnF0dmpWLWlfNXdLTmNvSDc2YjFUa3dwOFREallLRnhUUnhFS2p0NzNhVlFQdTE1cnd2X25CVUh4TFBVUHBFbjU3cEVyYkpCeTMwZC1rdnc3SDBUX1lFSDdkTUNVMkdVbUUyRlpEXzVXX2ZfOWFYYkdEcm5FSklKdzdYSzAtWlBGU213MUJDWWc?oc=5,,,"Kulgam: The body of a child, missing since a suspected leopard attack in Brinal Lummer village of Kulgam district, has been recovered by search teams.

