"Leopard Attacks, Kills Minor Girl in South Kashmir - Kashmir Life",2025-12-17,Jammu & Kashmir,South Kashmir,Leopard,Human Death,0.0,0.0,1.0,A minor girl was killed by a leopard.,0.95,single_incident,,Kashmir Life,https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPMTBJN2RYMXZnWmdqQXVndndpZlNzdElLWGZaeWh4RkF3ZDdQcGdCQXBwd3hVLTlKZUhpNGRmeUZiM1VvajF5RldTeExwbzBTdE9ORUJmeWczdl9hdWF0bjlfOFd1VG1DYzlVN1p4V2c2MGo3WU83di1NZ2NfTzVOQ0RTODlGZWlV?oc=5,,,"SRINAGAR: A leopard attacked and killed a minor girl in the Khiram Sirigufwara area of south Kashmir’s Anantnag district on Wednesday evening, officials said.
