Uttarakhand: Elderly woman killed in leopard attack in Pauri - News18,2025-11-13,Uttarakhand,Pauri,Leopard,Human Death,0.0,0.0,1.0,Elderly woman killed in leopard attack in Pauri.,0.98,single_incident,,News18,https://news.google.?oc=5,,,"Uttarakhand: Elderly woman killed in leopard attack in Pauri
Kotdwar, Nov 13 (PTI) A man-eating leopard attacked and killed an elderly woman in the Pokhra area of Pauri district in Uttarakhand on Thursday.
