Officials said that following the attack, one of the injured was shifted to District Hospital Kulgam, while the other two were taken to District Hospital Anantnag. The woman sustained minor injuries and is currently being treated at PHC Behibagh.

Officials said the condition of all the injured persons is stated to be stable.

The injured have been identified as Fayaz Ahmad Malla, Abdul Hamid Chopan and Dilshada, all residents of Reshipora Hermain.

