40-year-old Shepherd Critically Injured in Bear Attack in Jammu Kashmir - Kashmir Life,2026-05-30,Jammu & Kashmir,,Asiatic Black Bear,Human Injury,0.0,1.0,0.0,40-year-old shepherd critically injured in bear attack in Jammu Kashmir.,0.98,single_incident,,Kashmir Life,https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNZzZMb3U0c3UzZ1lnOXhjTGZfVVNNVTI4d1RHNGh5UkFiSmZNdk1ONmZCcnFsb2xFU1RKXzJZY2J6WWc5S05fSllHTDB1QW5KV2NVcTdaNGVmaXh1aWpBLUFqTURVN1U0aHJnUDlfZ3dIR0kxbVY5Z1JUYm9mQjl4NjdxWUktWldrXzM5T01TVFB3WFV6V0h6V2lxZHV0cnZodUw4X01B?oc=5,,,"SRINAGAR: A 40-year-old shepherd was critically injured in a bear attack in the Gagrian area of Poonch district in Jammu and Kashmir on Saturday while he was grazing cattle, officials said.

