Bear Attack in North Kashmir Leaves Two Critically Injured - Kashmir Life,2026-04-08,Jammu & Kashmir,,Asiatic Black Bear,Human Injury,0.0,2.0,0.0,Two people were injured in a bear attack in North Kashmir.,0.98,single_incident,,Kashmir Life,https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNWERhd280YVlIRjhYd1V6QURJa0FSUmx5eGN3dlpPaVN6bUt6US1fZVNTNnVIRTU2SE5KQkxWRGFJZFEzcFhvSUhsZGRvS2RxeE0tekM4OEFJRWtzcW1fNnJubWZoRGluV0NmZDR5eUNsZXhYSkRvczBGZ2N5X2xpbWdLYmtKMGFHU2M0Rl9fY0pEc2JF?oc=5,,,"SRINAGAR: Two persons sustained critical injuries after a bear attack in the Madian area of Kamalkote in north Kashmir’s Uri on Wednesday afternoon.

